flowchart LR
  WebBrowser["Web Browser / SPA"]
  MobileApp["Mobile App"]
  LB["Load Balancer / CDN"]
  Web["Web Server (NGINX)"]
  App["App Server (PHP/Laravel)"]
  Workers["Background Workers (Redis + Workers)"]
  Search["Search Index (Elasticsearch)"]
  Cache["Cache (Redis)"]
  DB["Primary DB (MySQL/Postgres)"]
  FileStore["File Storage (S3/Local)"]
  SMTP["Email/SMS Gateway"]
  PGW["Payment Gateway"]
  SSO["Auth Provider (SSO/LDAP)"]

  WebBrowser -->|HTTPS| LB
  MobileApp -->|HTTPS| LB
  LB --> Web
  Web -->|proxy| App

  App -->|read/write| DB
  App -->|cache read/write| Cache
  App -->|index/update| Search
  App -->|upload/download| FileStore
  App -->|enqueue job| Workers
  App -->|authenticate| SSO
  App -->|send notifications| SMTP
  App -->|process payments| PGW

  Workers -->|process jobs| App
  Workers -->|read/write| DB
  Workers -->|update cache| Cache
  Workers -->|send notifications| SMTP
  Workers -->|refunds / payment calls| PGW

  Search -->|index updates| App
  DB -->|replicate| Search
  FileStore -->|serve files| LB

  classDef comp fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#0f172a
  class LB,Web,App,Workers,Search,Cache,DB,FileStore,SMTP,PGW,SSO comp
  class LB,Web,App,Workers,Search,Cache,DB,FileStore,SMTP,PGW,SSO comp

  %% notes
  %% This physical DFD maps logical processes to physical components: clients -> LB -> Web/App -> DB/Cache/Search/Workers.
